WEBVTT

01:44.940 --> 01:47.780
At that time, when I met Munto,

01:48.750 --> 01:50.780
I was able to become a little bit stronger.

02:01.330 --> 02:02.970
Lady Ryuely!

02:02.970 --> 02:04.950
Lord Munto is back!

02:04.950 --> 02:07.030
The Akuto and our land are returning to their former states.

02:07.910 --> 02:10.680
The King was able to fulfill his promise.

02:12.440 --> 02:15.590
King Munto has called the Akuto back to the Heavens...

02:15.590 --> 02:18.720
...and has saved us from the imminent peril of destruction.

02:18.720 --> 02:20.020
Hooray!

02:22.530 --> 02:26.560
However, Munto, this is not the future you envisioned.

02:27.800 --> 02:29.890
The Akuto is...

02:29.890 --> 02:32.280
The almighty power, Akuto is...

02:32.280 --> 02:34.450
What is this?

02:34.450 --> 02:35.500
Unbelievable!

02:37.190 --> 02:42.790
Who would have believed that so much Akuto still existed in the Lower World?

02:42.790 --> 02:46.560
Moreover, it is filled with a radiance we have never seen.

02:46.560 --> 02:53.200
But it is too much for us to obtain as we are now.

03:15.940 --> 03:23.150
The seasons have changed since then, and I welcomed my second winter.

03:40.720 --> 03:44.050
Yumemi! Stop daydreaming.

03:44.050 --> 03:45.020
Hurry up and eat!

03:45.590 --> 03:48.360
You have entrance exams next year, so you've got to get your act together.

03:49.140 --> 03:50.520
All right.

03:50.520 --> 03:52.780
Papa! Look, it's Montarou!

03:53.590 --> 03:57.030
Hey, when my break starts, take me there, okay?

03:57.030 --> 03:58.830
It sounds like it'll be cold.

03:58.830 --> 04:00.890
I don't care if it's cold.

04:00.890 --> 04:03.080
Besides, a fatty like you shouldn't get cold.

04:03.080 --> 04:06.200
Huh? Chikara, Papa is all muscle.

04:06.200 --> 04:07.250
Go ahead and poke me.

04:07.250 --> 04:08.380
You liar.

04:16.650 --> 04:17.820
Again, huh?

04:20.130 --> 04:22.430
It's been happening a lot lately.

04:24.690 --> 04:26.290
Oh no, look at the time!

04:26.290 --> 04:28.130
Gosh, this happens because you're always out of it.

04:28.130 --> 04:29.570
Don't dawdle. Today is the closing ceremony, right?

04:30.240 --> 04:31.440
Chikara, you too.

04:31.440 --> 04:34.000
I have work starting today, so I'll be back late, okay?

04:34.000 --> 04:35.270
Make sure to show us your report card.

04:35.270 --> 04:36.080
Okay.

04:50.850 --> 04:51.510
Snow?

04:53.200 --> 04:54.110
No, this is different.

04:59.350 --> 05:00.960
Yumemi, good morning.

05:00.960 --> 05:01.810
'Morning!

05:01.990 --> 05:03.270
Ichiko!

05:03.270 --> 05:04.450
Let's go.

05:04.450 --> 05:06.040
You'll be late.

05:06.040 --> 05:06.990
Wait for me!

05:06.990 --> 05:07.630
Hurry up!

05:07.630 --> 05:10.120
Hey! Hey! It's a race!

06:00.360 --> 06:01.740
Mayoka!

06:08.460 --> 06:09.610
Steady yourself.

06:09.610 --> 06:12.160
I'm sorry, I'm losing my touch.

06:12.760 --> 06:13.340
Suzak!

06:16.080 --> 06:16.810
I leave him to you.

06:30.840 --> 06:31.900
Munto!

06:31.900 --> 06:32.670
The enemy.

06:32.670 --> 06:34.660
I've determined which one is Horguze's command ship.

06:35.210 --> 06:35.650
This is it.

06:37.510 --> 06:40.120
All right, Louie. Have everyone else fall back.

06:40.120 --> 06:41.800
Munto, don't be rash.

06:43.960 --> 06:44.820
We're falling back.

07:22.840 --> 07:23.800
Shall we pursue them?

07:23.800 --> 07:26.160
No, let our troops rest.

07:26.630 --> 07:30.300
They were testing the strength of us magicians.

07:30.300 --> 07:32.120
Next comes the true offensive.

07:33.880 --> 07:35.500
The enemy state Horguze's Magitech Unit,

07:35.500 --> 07:37.360
the force that has been invading the Magical Kingdom,

07:37.360 --> 07:39.670
has withdrawn from the Magical Kingdom's Western Airspace.

07:39.670 --> 07:43.390
The enemy state Horguze's Land-based Magitech Units are invading Shainan.

07:43.740 --> 07:45.890
Shainan shamans, commence retaliation.

07:46.410 --> 07:50.640
The enemy state Horguze's White Magitech Unit is only 300 units away from the country of Ondo.

07:51.960 --> 07:54.650
I considered this possibility, but
they acted sooner than I expected.

07:55.050 --> 08:00.650
To think that the kings of the Heavens would fall into chaos so easily...

08:01.060 --> 08:05.910
It's only a matter of time before the disorder of
Munto's Magical Kingdom and the three countries...

08:05.910 --> 08:09.870
...that withdrew from the Union spreads throughout the world.

08:09.860 --> 08:11.410
We must make haste.

08:11.610 --> 08:13.550
What is the status of Gntarl's ships?

08:13.550 --> 08:17.840
They are currently navigating the airspace 28,000 units from the Magical Kingdom.

08:17.840 --> 08:20.580
Estimated time of arrival is 62 hours from now.

08:21.710 --> 08:25.680
Send all of our newly completed destroyers to Gntarl.

08:25.910 --> 08:27.060
Wait!

08:27.060 --> 08:30.020
What about Ender's call for reinforcements?

08:30.260 --> 08:33.220
Now is not the time for shortsightedness.

08:33.220 --> 08:38.520
If we let our chance slip by spending time assisting a single country, the Heavens will be finished.

08:38.800 --> 08:40.980
Then why not tell the Kingdom of Ender-

08:40.980 --> 08:42.660
There is no need for that.

08:42.660 --> 08:46.030
The Kingdom of Ender is already planning to withdraw from the Union.

09:01.170 --> 09:02.210
We've been hit from behind!

09:02.430 --> 09:03.840
More Akuto missiles incoming!

09:04.210 --> 09:06.580
Defense team, ignore the missiles.

09:06.580 --> 09:09.350
Continue to put pressure on Horguze's magical units.

09:09.660 --> 09:11.760
Distance: 0.5 units from us.

09:11.760 --> 09:12.600
Incoming!

09:12.880 --> 09:14.600
Helmsman, don't let them hit us.

09:23.860 --> 09:26.740
All right! Put us back on course and prepare for the next assault!

09:26.760 --> 09:28.410
All surviving troops in the engine room have evacuated.

09:28.410 --> 09:29.460
Drop it!

09:35.390 --> 09:38.120
Haribe, head toward the engine room and lend a hand.

09:38.120 --> 09:38.690
Yes, ma'am!

09:39.380 --> 09:42.750
Leica, running with our backs to the enemy doesn't sit well with me.

09:42.780 --> 09:43.720
Let's strike back.

09:44.370 --> 09:49.100
No. Our duty is to buy time in order for the national defense squadron to reform.

09:49.920 --> 09:52.060
We can't be making selfish choices.

09:52.060 --> 09:52.720
Leica!

09:53.160 --> 09:54.250
Do not be afraid.

09:54.250 --> 09:56.430
The time we gain here is for the good of Ender.

09:56.430 --> 09:59.170
Lives will be saved by our actions. Stay strong.

10:01.330 --> 10:04.110
There are missing personnel in our defenses.
Defensive strength down by 20 percent.

10:07.150 --> 10:09.100
Movement of enemy magical units confirmed.

10:09.100 --> 10:11.280
More are approaching from the mothership.

10:11.990 --> 10:13.440
Should we fire on them?

10:13.440 --> 10:15.510
Izuku, what is the status of our carrier-borne aircraft?

10:15.510 --> 10:17.120
They have been fully equipped.

10:17.290 --> 10:20.630
Graham, Junin, come with me. We'll meet their attack here.

10:20.910 --> 10:21.970
Leica!

10:21.970 --> 10:23.970
Leave it to me. I promise I'll return.

10:23.970 --> 10:25.870
Seven enemy magical units are approaching.

10:25.870 --> 10:27.850
They will reach the ship within five minutes.

10:27.850 --> 10:30.170
Ramsey, set course for the Magical Kingdom.

10:30.170 --> 10:33.460
If we get them involved, maybe we can fight back.

10:35.280 --> 10:37.900
Did you hear her? Set course for the Magical Kingdom.

10:37.900 --> 10:38.640
Don't waste time!

10:42.430 --> 10:47.590
Munto, with the power that you called forth, the Heavens were spared from the Akuto crisis.

10:48.210 --> 10:49.170
However...

10:49.930 --> 10:54.290
This power seems to have brought fear into the hearts of the people of the Heavens.

10:54.290 --> 10:56.350
It seems to have robbed them of their intelligence.

10:57.100 --> 11:02.710
To those whose eyes have been skewed by this
impure Akuto, the brilliance has been overwhelming.

11:03.540 --> 11:05.970
To regulate this,

11:06.650 --> 11:09.560
we need that girl's power.

11:12.310 --> 11:13.470
What's going on?

11:13.470 --> 11:15.930
There is an irregularity in the gravitational field 300 units in front of us.

11:15.930 --> 11:16.980
Something is coming!

11:16.980 --> 11:17.970
On screen!

11:20.690 --> 11:21.390
It has appeared!

11:21.820 --> 11:22.650
Magnify it.

11:25.630 --> 11:26.440
Your Excellency!

11:26.440 --> 11:28.480
It's a guardian of space-time - the Outsider!

11:28.480 --> 11:30.790
Support squadron, all ships assume battle formations!

11:30.790 --> 11:33.700
Aim all main guns at the Outsider!

11:34.000 --> 11:35.160
Wait.

11:36.340 --> 11:38.410
That man-

11:38.410 --> 11:42.860
He is no longer an Outsider, the Guardian of Space-Time.

11:52.140 --> 11:53.760
They're coming! It's Horguze!

11:59.930 --> 12:02.640
Munto, what are you waiting for?

12:03.520 --> 12:07.650
If you hesitate here, the future that we have opened will collapse on us again.

12:09.290 --> 12:14.090
That wave of Akuto that that girl has brought
with her will eventually become mere sea foam.

12:15.130 --> 12:19.160
To grasp the true future, you must-

12:19.760 --> 12:26.100
That girl believed in both me and her future
when she ripped open the space-time continuum.

12:26.100 --> 12:29.590
At that moment, Akuto overflowed into the Heavens.

12:30.160 --> 12:31.420
That was enough.

12:31.880 --> 12:32.890
Munto...

12:33.570 --> 12:34.360
Munto!

12:35.130 --> 12:38.750
They've come. This time it's Horguze's Heavy Magical Battalion.

12:38.750 --> 12:39.590
All right.

12:40.180 --> 12:41.790
All who can fight will sortie.

12:42.930 --> 12:44.690
There's no need for you. Stay there.

12:45.280 --> 12:47.140
Ryuely, don't worry.

12:47.140 --> 12:48.760
I will protect this place.

12:52.750 --> 12:54.430
Lady Ryuely...

12:54.430 --> 12:57.070
Munto should know too.

12:57.070 --> 13:01.080
The true future will only be obtained with the cycle of Akuto.

13:01.530 --> 13:07.040
However, this cannot occur without the power of the Girl of Destiny.

13:07.410 --> 13:09.590
So why is Lord Munto...?

13:10.150 --> 13:11.550
He is afraid...

13:12.190 --> 13:18.090
...of the uncertainty of her future. He is afraid of her fleeting existence.

13:19.670 --> 13:24.810
At that time, her memories and emotions that flowed into me.

13:26.440 --> 13:31.270
Even now, it rocks within me as though it would be shattered at the faintest touch.

13:33.010 --> 13:37.340
If I were to reach out to her again, she would...

13:45.370 --> 13:46.210
Listen!

13:46.210 --> 13:52.720
Let us show the ferociousness of the Akuto-wielding magicians now that we have regained the Akuto.

13:54.690 --> 13:55.550
Follow him!

14:05.260 --> 14:08.300
What business do you have with the Magical Kingdom, Gntarl?

14:08.990 --> 14:12.050
I doubt that I need to tell you.

14:12.050 --> 14:18.320
I want to scoop up that reservoir of Akuto that Munto has struck upon, that girl of the other world.

14:18.980 --> 14:22.830
You think that I, an Outsider, will allow that?

14:23.230 --> 14:25.230
An Outsider?

14:25.840 --> 14:31.300
I know the meanings of those marks on your body.

14:32.350 --> 14:36.910
In the distant past, using that calamitous day for the people of the Heavens as a motive,

14:36.910 --> 14:42.350
they made the observation of Earth a taboo, and appointed a guardian over the door of time.

14:42.350 --> 14:46.450
That man who was given power greater than that of the Heavenly people, the guardian of space-time.

14:46.450 --> 14:50.310
That position is now known by the title "Outsider".

14:50.900 --> 14:54.850
Those who lay hands upon the field of space-time to attain great power...

14:54.850 --> 14:57.670
...will be afflicted by a curse which destroys them.

14:57.670 --> 15:00.240
Even a king of the Heavens is not immune.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.770
However, you helped Munto...

15:03.780 --> 15:08.500
...by creating a rift in the space-time continuum, allowing him to descend to the Lower World.

15:09.370 --> 15:10.750
Why?

15:11.200 --> 15:14.290
Did you, an Outsider, fear the Magical King?

15:14.970 --> 15:17.180
No, that's not it.

15:17.180 --> 15:23.560
You knew that Munto's actions would be the only way to rescue the Heavens.

15:24.680 --> 15:29.980
However, if a guardian abandons his duty and breaks the taboo,

15:29.980 --> 15:36.270
the curse that is part of his fate will be set
into motion and his body will be destroyed.

15:36.860 --> 15:39.030
Those marks are the proof.

15:39.300 --> 15:42.790
You are no longer an Outsider.

15:43.600 --> 15:47.900
Rest easy. We won't make the same mistake as Munto.

15:47.900 --> 15:53.040
I'll meet your expectations and bring an eternal future to the Heavens.

15:53.860 --> 15:57.300
You're pretty direct, aren't you, Gntarl?

15:58.530 --> 16:05.260
So, why are you here now in front of me?

16:05.260 --> 16:09.060
Do you mean to lend me some of your strength?

16:10.150 --> 16:13.210
After being released from my long contract,

16:13.210 --> 16:15.860
I decided to live the remainder of my life as I choose.

16:16.860 --> 16:21.690
So, after abandoning your role as a guardian... For the sake of the future of the Heavens,

16:21.930 --> 16:25.280
you now want to hamper my progress?

16:25.650 --> 16:29.180
Are you saying you have put your trust in Munto,

16:29.180 --> 16:31.370
the King who can't even control the Akuto properly?

16:31.650 --> 16:34.370
Don't get me wrong. I still dream.

16:34.740 --> 16:36.360
Then why?

16:36.360 --> 16:43.260
I have the ability to regulate the Akuto of this world and bring order here.

16:43.670 --> 16:45.550
I don't give a damn about the Akuto.

16:47.920 --> 16:50.560
Has your curse driven you mad?

16:51.090 --> 16:54.070
No longer do you have the strength of an Outsider.

16:54.070 --> 16:55.630
Take him down!

16:55.630 --> 16:57.060
All ships, fire in unison!

17:30.710 --> 17:31.400
Gass!

17:37.680 --> 17:40.360
As I suspected, I can't stop him by myself.

17:42.280 --> 17:44.050
Support ship Kanzer, heavily damaged!

17:44.050 --> 17:45.050
Root, heavily damaged.

17:45.050 --> 17:46.270
Crew evacuating ship!

17:46.270 --> 17:48.550
All support ships have become unable to function in battle.

17:48.550 --> 17:50.150
A section of the flagship has also been damaged.

17:50.150 --> 17:51.500
Our navigational systems are still up.

17:51.500 --> 17:54.660
Your Excellency! If we continue, only the
flagship will be able to carry out this mission.

17:54.660 --> 17:56.170
It matters not!

17:56.170 --> 17:57.920
We have no time to wait for reinforcements.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.370
Let us make haste!

18:04.620 --> 18:07.180
What a disgusting sight.

18:07.180 --> 18:10.130
The land of Ender has left the Union,

18:10.130 --> 18:13.970
and their Queen, Larko, has lost herself in the darkness of the chaos.

18:14.360 --> 18:17.440
The king of Horguze, Gridori...

18:17.950 --> 18:21.520
The king of Ondo, Raymon, too...

18:21.880 --> 18:24.540
During the thousands of years fueled only by the momentum of Akuto,

18:24.540 --> 18:28.610
people gained the wisdom of learning to live together.

18:28.620 --> 18:30.950
They lamented that they did not have enough power.

18:31.530 --> 18:37.480
They believed that power would bring stability to the Heavens.

18:37.480 --> 18:43.330
But now, we fear that power, and are ruled by it.

18:44.740 --> 18:47.820
High Akuto energy has been detected near Shainan.

18:47.820 --> 18:49.750
It has surpassed the limits of measurement.

18:53.670 --> 18:56.860
The king of Shainan, Hauto...

18:56.860 --> 18:59.240
The reach of disorder has spread.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.400
Our wisdom is now useless.

19:02.070 --> 19:05.690
Now all we can do is entrust everything to Gntarl.

19:06.640 --> 19:08.540
1200 units until we cross into the Magical Kingdom.

19:08.540 --> 19:11.580
Withdraw from the combat area and descend into the Lower World's airspace.

19:11.580 --> 19:13.000
Lowering altitude.

19:13.000 --> 19:14.870
Preparing to depart stationary plane.

19:15.570 --> 19:16.500
Prepared.

19:16.500 --> 19:18.010
Secondary target, confirmed.

19:19.070 --> 19:20.710
Primary target, confirmed.

19:21.650 --> 19:24.460
Prepare to descend on towns one through seven. Immediately!

19:24.700 --> 19:27.500
1120 units to mission execution point.

19:28.460 --> 19:30.520
Combating magician forces, withdrawing!

19:30.520 --> 19:32.770
The enemy Horguze forces have landed on Magical Kingdom shores.

19:33.360 --> 19:36.180
Let's grab some weapons and get out there. Defend the palace!

19:41.220 --> 19:42.600
Lady Ryuely!

20:28.640 --> 20:30.740
So you're Munto?

20:31.290 --> 20:34.700
It seems that you don't possess the powers of the previous Magical King.

20:35.420 --> 20:38.120
Who do you think you're talking to?

20:38.350 --> 20:39.740
Call me Lord Munto!

20:42.430 --> 20:44.870
You are incapable of conquering the Heavens.

20:45.660 --> 20:46.920
Die here!

20:52.590 --> 20:53.670
What an unnecessary move.

20:57.050 --> 20:58.990
Leica of Ender?

21:01.310 --> 21:03.050
Munto, are you all right?

21:07.170 --> 21:09.150
You're the United Army's...

21:12.890 --> 21:15.640
Ender has broken away from the Union.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.200
I am Leica of Ender.

21:17.430 --> 21:20.780
Why don't we set aside our differences and fight together?

21:20.780 --> 21:23.120
The enemy we face is the same.

21:27.900 --> 21:31.460
Munto, I thank you for saving the Heavens from the Akuto crisis.

21:31.460 --> 21:34.340
But, what do you plan to do with the Heavens?

21:36.340 --> 21:37.060
Munto!

22:08.650 --> 22:10.250
Gass!

22:15.120 --> 22:15.940
Gass?

22:28.200 --> 22:29.900
You again?

22:30.210 --> 22:31.870
Leave the rest to me.

22:31.870 --> 22:33.900
You need to go where you ought to go.

22:34.650 --> 22:36.490
Where I ought to go?

22:48.540 --> 22:49.620
Gass!

22:50.290 --> 22:51.140
Munto,

22:51.880 --> 22:54.880
show me your dream.

24:31.600 --> 24:35.360
Lady Ryuely, Lord Munto won't summon that girl,

24:35.360 --> 24:36.980
even though the Heavens are in danger!

24:36.980 --> 24:38.170
That's because he's a lolicon.

24:38.170 --> 24:39.020
No, I'm not!

24:39.020 --> 24:41.470
Don't deny it. It's not something to be embarrassed about.

24:41.470 --> 24:42.990
That's not something I want to hear from you!

24:43.420 --> 24:47.090
Next episode of The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl who Looks Up at the Sky:

24:47.090 --> 24:48.290
Hesitating.
